1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,900
Kwa ni mwua mwaka mkata ni migulu hili, sivile.

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,040
Kwa ni mwata ni migulu hili, choma kuchewake,

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,840
ase nchukwela kuwela kutuli.

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:11,560
Ase nkwela sipe ni lalago, ase watani uwa.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,440
Nyo kule ni lalago,

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,900
mato nipayaf, jonansa niko nipayamutote.

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,360
Kababa wa inu.

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,560
Niko sema pali nikule nyama zake,

9
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,800
ase nina itika, nika itika.

